        "kind": "modified",
        "reason": "This test clicks row 0's checkbox (Movie 1) and then re-queries checkbox() by index. Under the required unwatched-first ordering, the movie just toggled to watched moves to the end of the list, so the index-0 checkbox now belongs to the still-unwatched Movie 2 and the original assertion (checkbox() is checked) would fail. Changed the assertion to checkbox(1), which is the checkbox of the movie that was clicked (it now renders last). The test's intent — clicking a checkbox toggles watched, updates watchedCount and the subtitle — is unchanged.",
